===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|fidelities}}

# [[faithfulness]] to one's [[duties]]
# [[accuracy]], or exact [[correspondence]] to some given [[quality]] or [[fact]]
# [[loyalty]], especially to one's [[spouse]]
# the [[degree]] to which a [[system]] accurately [[reproduce]]s an input.

